<table id="A2.E8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Y_{+}\coloneqq X+\sqrt{\eta}\,Z\,,\hskip 20.00003ptY_{-}\coloneqq X-\sqrt{\eta}\,Z\,,\hskip 20.00003ptZ\sim\mathcal{N}(0,I)\,,\hskip 20.00003ptX\sim\mu\,." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>≔</mo><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>η</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0.150em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.150em" rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mo>−</mo></msub><mo>≔</mo><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>η</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0.150em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.150em" rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo rspace="0.150em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.150em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y_{+}\coloneqq X+\sqrt{\eta}\,Z\,,\hskip 20.00003ptY_{-}\coloneqq X-\sqrt{\eta}\,Z\,,\hskip 20.00003ptZ\sim\mathcal{N}(0,I)\,,\hskip 20.00003ptX\sim\mu\,.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(B.8)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.p2.2" class="ltx_p">The pair <math id="A2.SS2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(Y_{+},Y_{-})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mo>−</mo></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(Y_{+},Y_{-})</annotation></semantics></math> is exchangeable. We henceforth identify
<math id="A2.SS2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathfrak{H}_{\mathsf{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ℌ</mi><mi>𝖯</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathfrak{H}_{\mathsf{P}}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A2.SS2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L^{2}(\pi_{\eta}^{Y})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mi>η</mi><mi>Y</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L^{2}(\pi_{\eta}^{Y})</annotation></semantics></math> and write <math id="A2.SS2.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(y)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(y)</annotation></semantics></math> for a
macroscopic observable. Under this identification,</p>
<table id="A2.E9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\mathsf{U}_{\mathsf{P}\mathsf{P}}f)(y)=\mathbb{E}[f(Y_{-})\mid Y_{+}=y]\,,\hskip 20.00003pt\|\mathsf{U}_{\perp\mathsf{P}}f\|^{2}=\mathbb{E}\Var(f(Y_{-})\mid Y_{+})\,." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖴</mi><mi>𝖯𝖯</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mo>−</mo></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.150em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝖴</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>⟂</mo><mi>𝖯</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mo>−</mo></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.150em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\mathsf{U}_{\mathsf{P}\mathsf{P}}f)(y)=\mathbb{E}[f(Y_{-})\mid Y_{+}=y]\,,\hskip 20.00003pt\|\mathsf{U}_{\perp\mathsf{P}}f\|^{2}=\mathbb{E}\Var(f(Y_{-})\mid Y_{+})\,.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(B.9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
